      "content": "\n<div class=\"info-card\">\n  <p><strong>Chronological Designation:</strong> Period II: The Time of the Elves</p>\n  <p><strong>Core Theme:</strong> Golden Age of Ancillus I & Elven Scholars</p>\n</div>\n<h3>Historical Chronicle</h3>\n<p>The second era opened with the unexpected arrival of longships bearing fair-skinned elven scholars across the Western Ocean. Their landing inaugurated an unprecedented age of cross-cultural collaboration, enduring peace, and intellectual enrichment. Elven lore merged with Zingaran ambition, elevating the kingdom's prestige throughout the Hyborian world. To codify this alliance, King Ancillus I formally opened the realm's premier magical academy, placing its governance directly under elven stewardship to formalize magical instruction and safeguard the high arts.</p>\n\n",
