      "summary": "Progenitor Monarch of Zingara's golden era (Period II).",
      "content": "\n<div class=\"info-card\">\n  <p><strong>Historical Role:</strong> Progenitor Monarch of Zingara's golden era (Period II).</p>\n  <p><strong>Period of Prominence:</strong> Period II & Period VII</p>\n</div>\n<h3>Canonical Actions</h3>\n<p>Welcomed ocean-faring elven scholars to Zingara; founded the realm's premier elven-run magical academy in Kordava; established centuries of cultural prosperity. Centuries after his death, his tomb was desecrated by early necromancers in Period III. During Period VII, he was reanimated as a deathless warlord leading a massive zombie horde to reclaim his crown before being defeated by the mortal alliance.</p>\n<h3>Lasting Legacy on Modern Zingara</h3>\n<p>His bloodline forms the sole legal basis for royal legitimacy. The PCs derive their right to rule directly from their descent from Ancillus I.</p>\n\n",
      "gmSecrets": "Relics and crypts associated with King Ancillus I remain accessible in The Pit or ancient provincial ruins.",
