      "summary": "Cosmic Incarnation of Death and lover of King Daedalus (Period V).",
      "content": "\n<div class=\"info-card\">\n  <p><strong>Historical Role:</strong> Cosmic Incarnation of Death and lover of King Daedalus (Period V).</p>\n  <p><strong>Period of Prominence:</strong> Period V</p>\n</div>\n<h3>Canonical Actions</h3>\n<p>Present at the dawn of the city sacrifice in Kordava, completely checked out and indifferent to mortal bloodletting. Following the Starfall meteor strike, she personally condemned Daedalus to eternal conscious imprisonment beneath the earth because his megalomania proved tedious and boring.</p>\n<h3>Lasting Legacy on Modern Zingara</h3>\n<p>A lingering, terrifying cosmic presence in Zingaran lore, symbolizing the absolute, inescapable end of all things.</p>\n<p>Falmouth</p>\n\n",
