      "content": "\n<div class=\"info-card\">\n  <p><strong>Geographical Type:</strong> Rolling Agricultural Plains</p>\n  <p><strong>Strategic &amp; Economic Value:</strong> Warhorse breeding, citrus production, grain.</p>\n  <p><strong>Primary Encounter Hazards:</strong> Thrall labor revolts, noble press-gangs, highwaymen.</p>\n</div>\n<h3>Geographical Description</h3>\n<p>Attributes: Central/western provincial fiefs, warhorse breeding, citrus groves.</p>\n<p>Description: Prime agricultural hubs dominating central and western Zingara. Renowned across the Hyborian world for breeding high-mettled warhorses, cultivating extensive citrus groves, and operating vast manorial estates worked by bonded peasants and industrial thrall labor.</p>\n<p>4.3 Maritime Regions & Cursed Wilderness</p>\n\n<div class=\"gm-callout\">\n  <div class=\"gm-badge\">GM CONFIDENTIAL &bull; REGIONAL HAZARDS &amp; HOOKS</div>\n  <p><strong>Encounter Threats:</strong> Thrall labor revolts, noble press-gangs, highwaymen.</p>\n</div>\n",
